; Real binary wire grammar for `SemioImageMutation::encode_op`/`decode_op` — a documented
; simplification (matching gif's own hand-rolled op codec): `encode_op` is `print_op`'s UTF-8
; bytes verbatim, no separate binary framing. See the `📝️text` sibling for the `op` grammar.
op-binary = *OCTET   ; UTF-8 bytes of the 📝️text sibling's `op` production, no trailing NUL
